{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":53,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician upon Mahalath, Maschil, A ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Psalm"]}," of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 53:1"},"The fool hath said in his heart, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["There is"]}," no God. Corrupt are they, and have done abominable iniquity: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," none that doeth good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 53:2"},"God looked down from heaven upon the children of men, to see if there were ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["any"]}," that did understand, that did seek God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 53:3"},"Every one of them is gone back: they are altogether become filthy; ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," none that doeth good, no, not one. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 53:4"},"Have the workers of iniquity no knowledge? who eat up my people ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["as"]}," they eat bread: they have not called upon God. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 53:5"},"There were they in great fear, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["where"]}," no fear was: for God hath scattered the bones of him that encampeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["against"]}," thee: thou hast put ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them"]}," to shame, because God hath despised them. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 53:6"},"Oh that the salvation of Israel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["were come"]}," out of Zion! When God bringeth back the captivity of his people, Jacob shall rejoice, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and "]},"Israel shall be glad. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 53:6"}]}]}
